// claim that resolves only by accident is a claim that can silently stop resolving. Anything new in this
// module is imported explicitly for the same reason; do not read the list as noise.
//
// `BuildCacheDigestRefusal` / `DigestRefused` are GONE from the import list because the CARRIER IS GONE:
// review 81979 found the two digest-refusal causes folded into one arm separated only by a `reason: String`
// prefix, so gunbc.host.build_cache_daemon_ensure now carries the upstream effect's own refusal sum
// (`VerifiedBinaryInstallRefusal`, arms `Unverifiable` / `DigestMismatch`) instead of re-declaring a
// flattened copy. Claims here match those arms directly.
import gunbc.host.build_cache_daemon_ensure {
  BuildCacheEnsureFold,
  // USED BY stdout_for_leg BELOW. Said out loud because two other names in this module were used for weeks
